                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17863480" author="JIRAUSER305837" created="Sat, 6 Jul 2024 11:24:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PatrickJS/angular-websocket/issues/18&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/PatrickJS/angular-websocket/issues/18&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;On the old web interface, the problem is solved by downgrading the version of angular-websocket 1.1.0 to&lt;br/&gt;
&quot;angular-websocket&quot;: &quot;^1.0.13&quot;,&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17869340" author="reamer" created="Mon, 29 Jul 2024 12:30:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;If you read through your linked issue, you will come across the &#8220;reconnectIfNotNormalClose&#8221; flag. This should be set.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/289e954db5a2cd4577a8ecd0437ef2f7353cbf55/zeppelin-web/src/components/websocket/websocket-event.factory.js#L25-L26&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/289e954db5a2cd4577a8ecd0437ef2f7353cbf55/zeppelin-web/src/components/websocket/websocket-event.factory.js#L25-L26&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;```&lt;br/&gt;
  websocketCalls.ws = $websocket(baseUrlSrv.getWebsocketUrl());&lt;br/&gt;
  websocketCalls.ws.reconnectIfNotNormalClose = true;&lt;br/&gt;
```&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Have you tested version 2.0.0 of angular-websocket?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Diff between 1.1.0 and 1.0.13:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PatrickJS/angular-websocket/compare/v1.0.13...v1.1.0&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/PatrickJS/angular-websocket/compare/v1.0.13...v1.1.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think the problem with version 1.1.0 is that autoapply is not defined.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PatrickJS/angular-websocket/commit/75fda2100c52842b737851ed6f01d80ccd0f20f7#r17057652&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/PatrickJS/angular-websocket/commit/75fda2100c52842b737851ed6f01d80ccd0f20f7#r17057652&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That&apos;s the fix which is landed in 2.0.0&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PatrickJS/angular-websocket/commit/2ad7a09b53c3e47b31ed967362733fd1ca67c882&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/PatrickJS/angular-websocket/commit/2ad7a09b53c3e47b31ed967362733fd1ca67c882&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="17869386" author="JIRAUSER305837" created="Mon, 29 Jul 2024 15:19:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Updating to version 2.0.0 causes other errors, the code needs to be edited.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17871075" author="reamer" created="Mon, 5 Aug 2024 13:55:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Okay, can you provide a pull request?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17871554" author="JIRAUSER305837" created="Wed, 7 Aug 2024 07:13:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Reamer&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Reamer&quot;&gt;Reamer&lt;/a&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Can I create a PR to downgrade angular-websocket to 1.0.13?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17871572" author="reamer" created="Wed, 7 Aug 2024 08:12:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Yes please&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17871594" author="JIRAUSER305837" created="Wed, 7 Aug 2024 09:48:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Reamer&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Reamer&quot;&gt;Reamer&lt;/a&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;+ &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4784&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4784&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17872799" author="reamer" created="Mon, 12 Aug 2024 07:43:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Closed via &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4784&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4784&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
